title WF04 Lecturer verification - activity
|Lecturer|
start
:Complete profile and
verify account email;
repeat
  :Select institution,
provide staff evidence;
  :Submit request;
  |LumiGap platform|
  :Check eligibility, store
evidence, mark PENDING;
  :Notify administrators;
  |Administrator|
  :Open request, check
each source;
  :Decide: approve,
more info or reject;
  |LumiGap platform|
  :Apply decision to profile
and capabilities;
  |Lecturer|
  :Read decision;
repeat while (More info requested?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
if (Verified?) then ([approved])
  :Can accept reviews,
mentor, validate gaps;
else ([rejected])
endif
stop
note right
  A pending request is invalidated
  if position or institution changes.
end note
@enduml
